  "releaseNotes": "Update log4net to 3.4.0 and YamlDotNet to 18.1.0. Add opt-in read-only hub tests and explicitly selected room control tests with verified restoration. All 138 offline tests pass on both target frameworks; live reads and room controls were validated on a real hub. Public library API signatures are unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
